	<p>
		Paean Verity began with a simple conviction: that until when we understand the truth, then shall we be free and transformed (Joshua 1:8; Romans 12:2). It's meant to be carried — into our mornings, our quiet moments, even while at work— until it becomes the song our whole life sings.
	</p>

	<p>
		We create scripture-anchored devotionals, coloring books, and printable
		resources designed to help you build a home, a habit, and a heart shaped
		by timeless verity. Whether it's a coloring page that invites stillness, a
		devotional that walks you through scripture line by line, or a printable
		reminder to carry through your day, everything we make starts with the
		same question: does this help the word of God take root?
	</p>

	<p>
		Paean Verity is for anyone who wants spiritual growth and transformation.  We believe formation happens slowly, in small and repeated moments, and we want to be part of that process with you.
	</p>

	<p>
